# Texts of the local helper (ultar-agentd). The surface that shows its answers loads them.
agent.done = Done.
agent.failed = That could not be done.
agent.not_confirmed = Not confirmed, so nothing happened.
agent.not_allowed = The helper may not do this.
agent.says = {arg0}
agent.too_many_steps = Too many steps. Ask again in a shorter way.
agent.minimal.help = There is no language model on this device and none on a paired device that lends it. For now I understand fixed commands only: open an app, volume and a number, mute, Wi-Fi on or off, continue on another device, my devices.
agent.action.restart = Restart this device
agent.action.power_off = Switch this device off
agent.action.suspend = Put this device to sleep
agent.help.pairing = Pair two of your devices in Settings › Mesh: one device shows a six-digit code, the other one types it. The code is valid for five minutes and five attempts.
agent.help.continue = To continue on another device, open the menu of the app in the top bar and choose "Continue on another device", or press Super+M. The other device asks its person before anything opens.
agent.help.files = A file is offered to a paired device and stored there only after its person accepts. Received files are in the mesh inbox.
agent.help.model = A device without its own language model can think with the model of a paired device. Allow it there under Settings › Mesh › the device › Lend the language model.
agent.help.wifi = Wi-Fi is switched in the quick settings; the arrow of the tile lists the networks. Say "Wi-Fi on" or "Wi-Fi off" to me.
agent.help.bluetooth = Bluetooth is switched in the quick settings; the arrow of the tile searches for devices and pairs them.
agent.help.updates = Updates are under Settings › Updates. Without internet they can be installed from a USB drive.
agent.help.helper = I can open apps, set the volume, mute, switch Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and airplane mode, take a screenshot, lock the screen, list your devices, continue on another device, and answer questions about pairing, files, the model, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and updates.
